se,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105211","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105211.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105211.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds missing input/output ports to visual shader.\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97845\r\n\r\nCompared to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97845 this PR re-introduces `engine_version` to `VisualShader` resource to properly upgrade old visual shaders, so there is no compatibility breakage.\r\n\r\nAdded to Fragment Shader Mode Output:\r\n\r\n- TANGENT\r\n- BINORMAL\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_COLOR\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_DEPTH\r\n- SSS_TRANSMITTANCE_BOOST\r\n- FOG\r\n- RADIANCE\r\n- IRRADIANCE\r\n\r\nAdded to Vertex Shader Inputs:\r\n\r\n- BONE_INDICES (transformed to vec4 from uvec4)\r\n- BONE_WEIGHTS\r\n- MAIN_CAM_INV_VIEW_MATRIX\r\n- POSITION\r\n\r\nAdded Fragment Shader Output:\r\n\r\n- POSITION\r\n\r\nUnsupported:\r\n\r\n- MODEL_NORMAL_MATRIX\r\n- MODELVIEW_NORMAL_MATRIX\r\n\r\n(They are using `mat3` type, which is unsupported by visual shader).","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105211/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}